<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1961831205"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1633229836"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="余命2:30"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ピノキオピー / 初音ミク"/><amll:meta key="album" value="余命2:30"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:30.446"><div begin="00:00.962" end="02:30.446"><p begin="00:00.962" end="00:02.389" itunes:key="L1">あ 生まれた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 诞生了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a yi ma le ta</span></p><p begin="00:02.390" end="00:04.069" itunes:key="L2">何をして生きようか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要为了什么活着呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">nani wo xi te yi ki yo wu ka</span></p><p begin="00:04.070" end="00:07.873" itunes:key="L3">無限の可能性が広がる まだ8秒だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无限可能无尽延伸 还剩最后8秒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na kili no ka nou sei ga hilo ga lu ma da 8biyo da</span></p><p begin="00:07.874" end="00:09.698" itunes:key="L4">あんなことできるかな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我能做到那样的成就吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a n na ko to de ki lu ka na</span></p><p begin="00:09.699" end="00:11.515" itunes:key="L5">何にでもなれるかな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我能实现所有的憧憬吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">nani ni de mo na le lu ka na</span></p><p begin="00:11.516" end="00:13.232" itunes:key="L6">来るべき不幸から<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">转身背对</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">lai lu be ki fu saqi ka la</span></p><p begin="00:13.233" end="00:15.223" itunes:key="L7">目を背けながら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">本该降临的不幸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me wo se ke na ga la</span></p><p begin="00:15.484" end="00:17.256" itunes:key="L8">真面目に生きようか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">认真地活下去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma omote me ni yi ki yo wu ka</span></p><p begin="00:17.257" end="00:19.049" itunes:key="L9">小狡く生きようか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">耍点小聪明活着吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko zulu ku yi ki yo wu ka</span></p><p begin="00:19.050" end="00:21.133" itunes:key="L10">君を助けたい 蹴落としたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想帮助你 想排斥你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kimi wo tasu ke ta yi ke laku to xi ta yi</span></p><p begin="00:21.134" end="00:22.691" itunes:key="L11">どっちも自分だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论哪一面都是我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do っqi mo mizuka wa da</span></p><p begin="00:22.692" end="00:24.437" itunes:key="L12">夢や恋はファストで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦想 恋情总是转瞬即逝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yume ya len ha fu a su to de</span></p><p begin="00:24.438" end="00:26.631" itunes:key="L13">努力はつらいよね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">努力是如此痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do qikala ha cu la yi yo ne</span></p><p begin="00:26.632" end="00:27.947" itunes:key="L14">本や映画は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">书本和电影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hon ya wucu ka ha</span></p><p begin="00:27.948" end="00:30.273" itunes:key="L15">あらすじだけでいいかな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是不是看看大纲就好了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a la su ji da ke de yi yi ka na</span></p><p begin="00:31.891" end="00:35.367" itunes:key="L16">余命2:30<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">余命2:30</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">amali yinoqi 2:30</span></p><p begin="00:35.368" end="00:38.777" itunes:key="L17">余命2:30<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">余命2:30</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">amali yinoqi 2:30</span></p><p begin="00:38.778" end="00:40.480" itunes:key="L18">「ありがとう」「さよなら」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“谢谢”“再见”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「a li ga to wu 」「sa yo na la 」</span></p><p begin="00:40.481" end="00:43.109" itunes:key="L19">「またね」をくり返して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“再见”不断重复如此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「ma ta ne 」wo ku li kae xi te</span></p><p begin="00:43.110" end="00:46.277" itunes:key="L20">もう45秒の春<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已过去45秒的春</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo wu 45biyo no halu</span></p><p begin="00:46.278" end="00:49.834" itunes:key="L21">余命2:30<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">余命2:30</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">amali yinoqi 2:30</span></p><p begin="00:49.835" end="00:53.056" itunes:key="L22">使い捨てられる青<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用完就被舍弃的青蓝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">cuka yi su te la le lu ao</span></p><p begin="00:53.057" end="00:54.933" itunes:key="L23">3分に満たない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还不够3分钟</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">3wa ni mi ta na yi</span></p><p begin="00:54.934" end="00:57.468" itunes:key="L24">替えが利く ぼくの命を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我这能被轻易取代的生命</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka e ga li ku bo ku no yinoqi wo</span></p><p begin="00:57.469" end="01:00.806" itunes:key="L25">涙で消費しないでね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请别用泪水无情消费</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">namida de ki hi xi na yi de ne</span></p><p begin="01:07.823" end="01:09.688" itunes:key="L26">夢ってこんなもんか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦想 不过如此啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yume っte ko n na mo n ka</span></p><p begin="01:09.689" end="01:11.473" itunes:key="L27">恋ってこんなもんか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恋爱 不过如此啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">len っte ko n na mo n ka</span></p><p begin="01:11.474" end="01:13.148" itunes:key="L28">人生ってまるで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人生 就像是</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hito yi っte ma lu de</span></p><p begin="01:13.149" end="01:15.534" itunes:key="L29">よくある歌みたいだな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那首稀松平常的歌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ku a lu wuta mi ta yi da na</span></p><p begin="01:15.535" end="01:17.318" itunes:key="L30">1分以上過ぎて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">过了1分多钟</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">1wa yi wei ka gi te</span></p><p begin="01:17.319" end="01:19.147" itunes:key="L31">「自分」を思い知って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">才开始知晓真正的“自己”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「mizuka wa 」wo omo yi xi っte</span></p><p begin="01:19.148" end="01:21.876" itunes:key="L32">だけど 悟るには まだまだ早いね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但要有所顿悟 还为时尚早</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ke do sato lu ni ha ma da ma da haya yi ne</span></p><p begin="01:21.877" end="01:23.473" itunes:key="L33">チクタク チクタク<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘀嗒 嘀嗒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">qi ku ta ku qi ku ta ku</span></p><p begin="01:23.474" end="01:25.835" itunes:key="L34">もういない君を想う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">思念早已不再的你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo wu yi na yi kimi wo omo wu</span></p><p begin="01:25.836" end="01:29.392" itunes:key="L35">1分前 描いた夢とは ほど遠いが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">1分钟前的自己 与憧憬的梦想还相距甚远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">1wa mae ega yi ta yume to ha ho do tou yi ga</span></p><p begin="01:31.046" end="01:34.597" itunes:key="L36">余命2:30<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">余命2:30</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">amali yinoqi 2:30</span></p><p begin="01:34.598" end="01:37.943" itunes:key="L37">余命2:30<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">余命2:30</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">amali yinoqi 2:30</span></p><p begin="01:37.944" end="01:39.682" itunes:key="L38">「よかった」「もうだめだ」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“太好了”“不行了”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「yo ka っta 」「mo wu da me da 」</span></p><p begin="01:39.683" end="01:42.213" itunes:key="L39">「まあいっか」をくり返して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“算了吧”不断重复如此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「ma a yi っka 」wo ku li kae xi te</span></p><p begin="01:42.214" end="01:45.341" itunes:key="L40">1分45秒の秋<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">1分45秒的秋</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">1wa 45biyo no aki</span></p><p begin="01:45.342" end="01:48.872" itunes:key="L41">余命2:30<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">余命2:30</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">amali yinoqi 2:30</span></p><p begin="01:48.873" end="01:52.293" itunes:key="L42">また一つ消える魔法<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又再有一个魔法消失</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta yiqi cu ki e lu ma hou</span></p><p begin="01:52.294" end="01:53.970" itunes:key="L43">君のため？ ぼくのため？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是为了你？还是为了我？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kimi no ta me ？bo ku no ta me ？</span></p><p begin="01:53.971" end="01:56.608" itunes:key="L44">大袈裟に嘆く命を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夸张哀叹的生命</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">oo ke xia ni nage ku yinoqi wo</span></p><p begin="01:56.609" end="01:59.926" itunes:key="L45">どうか美化しすぎないでね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请别过分美化了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do wu ka bi ka xi su gi na yi de ne</span></p><p begin="02:00.227" end="02:01.620" itunes:key="L46">あの日 読み飛ばした<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像那天 敷衍阅读的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no hi yo mi to ba xi ta</span></p><p begin="02:01.621" end="02:03.708" itunes:key="L47">本や映画みたいに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">书本和电影一般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hon ya wucu ka mi ta yi ni</span></p><p begin="02:03.709" end="02:06.884" itunes:key="L48">ぼくの命も 短い歌になって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的生命 化为了一首短暂的歌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku no yinoqi mo miji yi wuta ni na っte</span></p><p begin="02:06.885" end="02:10.833" itunes:key="L49">余命2:30でさよならでも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">余命2:30 尽管说下再见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">amali yinoqi 2:30de sa yo na la de mo</span></p><p begin="02:10.834" end="02:13.883" itunes:key="L50">幸せだったと言わせて欲しいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也希望能让我说 此生幸福美满</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">saqi se da っta to yi wa se te yoku xi yi no</span></p><p begin="02:14.005" end="02:17.548" itunes:key="L51">余命2:30<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">余命2:30</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">amali yinoqi 2:30</span></p><p begin="02:17.549" end="02:20.864" itunes:key="L52">余命2:30<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">余命2:30</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">amali yinoqi 2:30</span></p><p begin="02:20.865" end="02:22.665" itunes:key="L53">3分に満たない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还不够3分钟</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">3wa ni mi ta na yi</span></p><p begin="02:22.666" end="02:25.215" itunes:key="L54">もう終わる ぼくの命を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我这快要结束的生命</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo wu o wa lu bo ku no yinoqi wo</span></p><p begin="02:25.216" end="02:27.846" itunes:key="L55">他人事って思わないでね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请别当做他人闲事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hito koto っte omo wa na yi de ne</span></p><p begin="02:27.969" end="02:30.446" itunes:key="L56">あ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a</span></p></div></body></tt>